    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) if any other audio is playing, including audio from an app using the [`ambient`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/ambient.md) category.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 [`ambient`](avaudiosession/category-swift.struct/ambient.md) 카테고리를 사용하는 앱의 오디오를 포함해 다른 오디오가 재생 중이면 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)를 반환합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4ebdd167b6567204135f4d2d6c569a6c324f7e0cf30325500e029e6f481af1f8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Most apps should instead use the [`secondaryAudioShouldBeSilencedHint`](avaudiosession/secondaryaudioshouldbesilencedhint.md) property, because it’s more restrictive when considering whether primary audio from another app is playing.",
      "ko": "대부분의 앱은 다른 앱의 기본 오디오가 재생 중인지 판단할 때 더 엄격한 [`secondaryAudioShouldBeSilencedHint`](avaudiosession/secondaryaudioshouldbesilencedhint.md) 속성을 대신 사용해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3919a5b7ad8af86ba64d6537fc21bcffaf3b50ace19068656906f8684cd31056",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
